    <itunes:duration>01:41:06</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo5gtog4MpMly6K5-OW43rpFPRG7.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>番外 | 《日落时分》半场repo，熟龄姐哥的感情观进化到哪一步了？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69be00dc2d318777c9f6e93b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69be00dc2d318777c9f6e93b</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 21 Mar 2026 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这期番外，聊聊《日落时分说爱你》。</span></p><span></span><p><span>从第一期追到大理篇完结（截至本期节目录制的之间），伏波已经从只看正篇，迅速发展到连陪看直播都要狂追，太上头了，腾讯做恋综真是有一套！而恰巧咱们的老朋友——来自【</span><a href="https://podcaster.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/66d43320cb87427be9804886/69be00dc2d318777c9f6e93b/%E6%89%BE%E6%89%BE%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%20https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6725dd0d7f8cdebc882b232d" data-url="https://podcaster.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/66d43320cb87427be9804886/69be00dc2d318777c9f6e93b/%E6%89%BE%E6%89%BE%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%20https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6725dd0d7f8cdebc882b232d"><span>找找自己</span></a><span>】的老薛和cica，还有新朋友——cica的亲友斯图，也在如火如荼地追更中，于是一拍即合，来聊聊🫣</span></p><span></span><p><span>具体聊了些啥：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="193">03:13</a> 我们是怎么发现这档“熟龄恋爱竞演节目”的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="570">09:30</a> 马晴，是雌竞，还是直面欲望？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="894">14:54</a> 刘玫，矛盾集合体，直球也要讲究基本法！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1321">22:01</a> Joe＆礼礼＆徐工，夕阳红之恋的标杆，和节目组做的局？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1730">28:50</a> 罗飞＆马晴，“非典型”白男，和顺势而变的“洛丽塔”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2599">43:19</a> Joe VS Ken，表里如一的利他VS自以为是的利己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2724">45:24</a> 老登现身说法：不轻信，但颜值即正义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3035">50:35</a> 王老师，沪上大女主恐怕也拗不过面子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3350">55:50</a> 在恋综里陷入孤独怪圈，如何破局？</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>（这里对兔子的探讨一笔带过了，浅浅滑跪）</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4113">68:33</a> Joe的谨慎与戒备</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4371">72:51</a> 目目，百元约会里的街角智者</span><em><span>（这一期的Joe也值得表扬！）</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4970">82:50</a> 刘玫 VS 麦琳，是人设，是浑然天成，还是剪辑构陷？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5378">89:38</a> 我们应该在多大程度上，理解和包容一个人的过往？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5807">96:47</a> 熟龄女性的伴侣观：不为婚姻，只求陪伴，高质量的独身也不错</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6088">101:28</a> 官方二创（嘉宾陪看）相当成功！再豁出去一点就好了</span></p><span></span><p><span>现在节目已经完结啦，我们也录完了完结篇的repo，很快就会上线。敬请期待~</span></p><span></span><p><span>评论区见，下一期见！</span></p>]]></description>
